1
00:00:01,913 --> 00:00:04,413
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:08,544
(Leonard:)Look at all these activities
the university has.

3
00:00:08,547 --> 00:00:11,577
(Leonard:)Rock climbing club,
archery, flag football.

4
00:00:11,583 --> 00:00:14,923
(Sheldon:)Had me at flag,
lost me at football.

5
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:17,550
(Penny:)Yeah, I think it's great you
guys want to get more exercise,

6
00:00:17,556 --> 00:00:20,486
(Penny:)but do you really think sports
is the right choice for you?

7
00:00:20,492 --> 00:00:22,462
(Leonard:)What are you saying?
We're not coordinated enough

8
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,560
(Leonard:)to play sports?

9
00:00:23,561 --> 00:00:25,961
(Penny:)Okay, Leonard, sweetheart,

10
00:00:25,964 --> 00:00:29,264
(Penny:)you twisted your ankle
playing Scrabble.

11
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,100
(Leonard:)I got a triple-word score

12
00:00:32,103 --> 00:00:33,773
with a double letter "Q."
If that's not a time

13
00:00:33,772 --> 00:00:36,672
to bust out the Scrabble dance,
what's the point of having one?

14
00:00:38,575 --> 00:00:42,415
(Leonard:)Hey, Barry Kripke
started a fencing club.

15
00:00:42,413 --> 00:00:46,383
(Sheldon:)Interesting. Sword fighting does
hold a certain elegant appeal.

16
00:00:46,384 --> 00:00:48,214
(Sheldon:)And I would imagine
it meets many

17
00:00:48,219 --> 00:00:50,849
(Sheldon:)of our personal criteria
for a sport.

18
00:00:50,855 --> 00:00:53,185
(Leonard:)It's indoors, so no sunscreen.

19
00:00:53,857 --> 00:00:54,857
(Sheldon:)No throwing, no catching,

20
00:00:54,859 --> 00:00:56,659
(Sheldon:)no running.

21
00:00:56,661 --> 00:00:59,631
(Leonard:)No gym shorts
that can be yanked down.

22
00:01:00,797 --> 00:01:02,027
(Sheldon:)Or worse, up.

